      {
        "id": 136569,
        "name": "Melee: SD Remix",
        "summary": "Melee: SD Remix is a gameplay mod of Super Smash Bros. Melee to make it more balanced. The top tier characters Fox, Falco, Sheik, Marth, Jigglypuff, and Peach were unchanged, while all other characters were given a somewhat large number of buffs and an extremely small number of nerfs. The remaining characters were modified according to three principles: to emphasize existing character strengths, to increase mobility, and to uphold a character's \"style\". Version 3.2 has been released in August 2015.",
