      {
        "id": 321833,
        "name": "Bikmin 269 DX: Director's Cut",
        "summary": "Bikmin 269 DX: Director's Cut is a full game mod of Pikmin 2 with a brand new story, and new areas! Yes, every area is new and fully modeled! This isn't just a \"repaint\" of Pikmin 2, it contains an entire new story with new characters from a parallel Pikmin universe where many things are strange, a little bit memey, or just not correct. With over 130 new treasures to collect and brand new mechanics to make the game feel fresh this mod is essentially a new game. This mod is not meant to be taken too seriously in most aspects, but its gameplay is meant to be fresh and creative for fans of the Pikmin series to enjoy even if they don't care about the memes.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co910a.jpg",
        "release_date": 1729555200,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Real Time Strategy (RTS)",
        "platform_ids": "21",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/bikmin-269-dx-directors-cut",
        "cached_at": 1772529807
      },
      {
        "id": 323833,
        "name": "Mario Party 4 Deluxe",
        "summary": "Mario Party 4 Deluxe is a mod of Mario Party 4 that expands the game by changing its item roster to one of a whopping 36 items. Does the Mini-Mega system get tiresome pretty quickly? Well, here's more items to play with to spice up the Mario Party 4 experience! Returning, important staples from the Mario Party series that were absent in vanilla Mario Party 4, include Mushrooms, Golden Mushrooms, Skeleton Keys and Plunder Chests! The items from Mario Party 3 are back, too; the Reverse Mushroom, Cellular Shopper, and Bowser Phone are now at your disposal. Items from newer Mario Parties and the Mario Party 1 dice blocks have also made their way into this mod, as well as 5 rare items that you can get if you're lucky enough (including the dreaded Wacky Watch)!",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_big/co97bf.jpg",
        "release_date": 1728172800,
        "rating": null,
