        "name": "Luigi's Mansion",
        "summary": "The European and Australian version of Luigi's Mansion differs from the previously released versions by changing the post-game content, the Hidden Mansion mode. While it was just a slightly tweaked harder mode in the other regions, without major differences in level design, this version completely enhances the whole quest by mirroring the map, changing enemy and key items placement, modifying stats and reducing health item locations.",
